[character name="mion"]
[FACEVIEW storage="mion_CD1_5_FACE_sifuku"]
【澪音】[r]「止步于二次选拔就说明…仅靠这种程度的有趣还不足以突破重围」
[np]
[FACEHIDE]

[mion storage="A_sifuku_M AB1_3_M"]
[playcv storage="mion_mion_00520_019.ogg" name="mion"]
[character name="mion"]
[FACEVIEW storage="mion_AB1_3_FACE_sifuku"]
【澪音】[r]「这样的话，研究当下畅销元素并加以运用…就是必要的努力」
[np]
[FACEHIDE]

[character name="ryuichi"]
【龙一】[r]「哎…难道说…」
[np]

[mion storage="C_sifuku_M CD1_8_M"]
[playcv storage="mion_mion_00520_020.ogg" name="mion"]
[character name="mion"]
[FACEVIEW storage="mion_CD1_8_FACE_sifuku"]
【澪音】[r]「……被身为男友的龙一这么认真地劝说……我也只能尊重这种想法了」
[np]
[FACEHIDE]

[mion storage="B_sifuku_M AB1_1_M"]
